# REGRESSION (`todo/t0841`, R48 Track D1) — the owned name is consumed INSIDE
# THE CONDITION, and nowhere else.
#
# THE SUB-POSITION AXIS, and the cell that discriminates two candidate fixes.
# A comprehension's `if` filter runs once per element exactly as the element
# expression does, so a consuming use inside it needs the same back-edge
# protection. Route the condition after the two-pass call — the shape the
# pre-fix code had, walking it first in a single pass — and the element
# position is protected while this one is not. Here `[s]` is an array-literal
# element, a consuming position, and `s` is used nowhere else in the function,
# so the walker sees it dead at the comprehension and moves it once per
# iteration.
#
# The fix puts the condition in the shared helper's `tail` slot, which runs in
# BOTH passes.
#
# AXIS CELL: comprehension kind = LIST · body sub-position = CONDITION ·
# consuming position inside it = array-literal element · source = RANGE ·
# name type = String (heap-forced).
#
# RED-VERIFIED at pre-fix HEAD, both lanes: run rc 134, `free(): double free
# detected in tcache 2` (C and `--backend=llvm`); `--sanitize` reports
# `AddressSanitizer: attempting double-free on ...` with
# `SUMMARY: AddressSanitizer: double-free`.

String mk(String a, String b):
    return a + b

void main():
    String s = mk("a", "b")
    Vector[int] out = [i for i in 0..3 if [s].len() > 0]
    print(out.len())
